      "lines": [
        "如果在关于轴$l$的轴对称下，点$M_1$是点$M$的象，那么**记**",
        "**成**$S_l(M)=M_1$，记号$S_l(\\Phi)=\\Phi_1$表明，在关于轴$l$对称下，",
        "**图形**$\\Phi$**被映射成图形**$\\Phi_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**定理17. 轴对称是位移.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明. 设$S_l(M)=M_1$，$S_l(N)=N_1$(图118). 要证明",
        "$|MN|=|M_1N_1|$. 如图118所示，作向量$\\vec{m},\\vec{n},\\vec{p}$. 根据轴对",
        "称的定义有："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 118",
      "box": [
        396,
        670,
        584,
        382
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-118"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 118",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{p}=\\vec{n}\\cdot\\vec{p}=0$.",
        "根据多边形法则(§18)得到：",
        "$\\overrightarrow{MN}=-\\vec{m}+\\vec{p}+\\vec{n}$；$\\overrightarrow{M_1N_1}=\\vec{m}+\\vec{p}-\\vec{n}$.",
        "于是，$|MN|^2=\\vec{m}^2+\\vec{p}^2+\\vec{n}^2-2\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{n}$，",
        "$|M_1N_1|^2=\\vec{m}^2+\\vec{p}^2+\\vec{n}^2-2\\vec{m}\\cdot\\vec{n}$.",
        "因此，$|MN|^2=|M_1N_1|^2$，即$|MN|=|M_1N_1|$. ■"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从定理17得到，在轴对称下，任何图形映射成与它合同",
        "的图形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "注. 利用直线和平面垂直性的判定定理以及轴对称的性",
        "质，可以证明在空间中任意位置的两个三角形合同的判定定",
        "理. 这里判定定理的阐述同平面几何中一样(参看《附录》，第",
        "297页)."
      ]
    },
